[
    {
        "content": "<p>Am I correct that the only definition for  Partially ordered monoids is the definition for commutative monoids?<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/40f05009d036d2e4b488e8a01f559a6036ec2484/Mathlib/Algebra/Order/Monoid/Defs.lean#L32-L37\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/40f05009d036d2e4b488e8a01f559a6036ec2484/Mathlib/Algebra/Order/Monoid/Defs.lean#L32-L37</a></p>",
        "id": 599124998,
        "sender_full_name": "Nikolai Iorgov",
        "timestamp": 1780310750
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You can use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=MulLeftMono#doc\">docs#MulLeftMono</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=MulRightMono#doc\">docs#MulRightMono</a></p>",
        "id": 599132834,
        "sender_full_name": "Yaël Dillies",
        "timestamp": 1780313394
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thank you! I will use them.</p>\n<p>Just a remark, from doc:<br>\n\"You should usually not use this very granular typeclass directly, but rather a typeclass like<br>\n<code>OrderedCommMonoid</code>\". I can not find a typeclass <code>OrderedCommMonoid</code>.</p>",
        "id": 599142196,
        "sender_full_name": "Nikolai Iorgov",
        "timestamp": 1780316085
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yes, indeed, you should usually not care about non-commutative ordered monoids. This just means you are an unusual user <span aria-label=\"wink\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f609\" role=\"img\" title=\"wink\">:wink:</span></p>",
        "id": 599149630,
        "sender_full_name": "Yaël Dillies",
        "timestamp": 1780318097
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think <code>OrderedCommMonoid</code> should be corrected to <code>IsOrderedMonoid</code> in the doc</p>",
        "id": 599156346,
        "sender_full_name": "Weiyi Wang",
        "timestamp": 1780319782
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"387244\">Yaël Dillies</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/Partially.20ordered.20monoids/near/599149630\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, indeed, you should usually not care about non-commutative ordered monoids. This just means you are an unusual user <span aria-label=\"wink\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f609\" role=\"img\" title=\"wink\">:wink:</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>note that the ordinals are a noncommutative ordered monoid</p>",
        "id": 599169347,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1780322983
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"873350\">Weiyi Wang</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/Partially.20ordered.20monoids/near/599156346\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think <code>OrderedCommMonoid</code> should be corrected to <code>IsOrderedMonoid</code> in the doc</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/37835\">#37835</a></p>",
        "id": 599175001,
        "sender_full_name": "Yaël Dillies",
        "timestamp": 1780324312
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>And indeed comparatively few people are writing lemmas about ordinals</p>",
        "id": 599245804,
        "sender_full_name": "Yaël Dillies",
        "timestamp": 1780344502
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"387244\">Yaël Dillies</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/Partially.20ordered.20monoids/near/599149630\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, indeed, you should usually not care about non-commutative ordered monoids. This just means you are an unusual user <span aria-label=\"wink\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f609\" role=\"img\" title=\"wink\">:wink:</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I am working on Bergman's Diamond Lemma, which in turn can be used to prove the Poincaré–Birkhoff–Witt theorem.</p>\n<p>The story starts from a <code>MonoidAlgebra</code> with elements being finite linear combinations of elements (=non-commutative monomials) from <code>FreeMonoid X</code> or, equivalently, <code>List X</code>. The proof is constructed as a study of a rewriting system on the <code>MonoidAlgebra</code>. The termination of rewriting processes can be provided by an ordering on monomials such that the result after rewriting becomes \"smaller\". <br>\nFor this story, the non-commutative monoids are just usual lists with multiplication being concatenation.<br>\nThe standard lexicographic order on lists respects multiplication (concatenation) from the left and does not respect multiplication from the right. <br>\nI use DegLex order which order the lists by lengths and then (for the equal lengths) lexicographically.  <br>\nWith such order, usual <code>List X</code> becomes a non-commutative ordered monoid :)</p>\n<p>Some code realizing this order:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LinearOrder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- DegLex order for FreeMonoid α -/</span>\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\"> The pattern is borrowed from the original DegLex file:</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">DegLex order is a Lex Product order on length of List (degree) and then on List</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">onFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Prod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Lex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">length</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex_def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Iff</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLexLE_def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Iff</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_refl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_trans</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LE</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">le</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">repeat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Prod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lex_def</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">lt_iff_le_not_ge</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LE</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">le</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simpa</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LT</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lt</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeMonoid</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DegLex</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">onFun</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_or</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lt_eq</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lex_lt</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"